{"title":"WinDev et callbacks : la méthode simple pour gérer vos événements efficacement","content":"<p>Ce code <span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">permet de gérer des </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">évènement avec callbacks</strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\"> dans WinDev.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">💡</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Concrètement :</strong></p><p><br></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Vous pouvez </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">mettre à jour automatiquement plusieurs fenêtres</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Actualiser vos </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">tableaux de bord</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Ou notifier </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">toutes les parties de votre application</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> qu’un événement vient de se produire</span></li></ol><p><br></p><div class=\"ql-code-block-container\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div class=\"ql-code-block\">gtaCallBack est un tableau associatif (AvecDoublon) de procédure</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"><br></div><div class=\"ql-code-block\">PROCÉDURE DeclareProcedureNotification(sNotification est une chaîne, pCallBack est une procédure)  </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"> gtaCallBack[sNotification] = pCallBack</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"><br></div><div class=\"ql-code-block\">PROCÉDURE Notifie(sNotification est une chaîne)  </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"> POUR i = 1 _À_ gtaCallBack[sNotification]..Occurrence  </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\">  pCallBack est une procédure &lt;- gtaCallBack[sNotification,i]  </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\">  pCallBack()  </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"> FIN </div><div class=\"ql-code-block\"><br></div></div><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">🔹</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Petit exemple avec lambdas </strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">{} =&gt;</span></p><div class=\"ql-code-block-container\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">// Quelque part dans mon code</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">DeclareProcedureNotification(\"MajDonnées\", () =&gt; {</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">    // Mon super code</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">    Info(\"Dashboard mis à jour\")</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">})</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\"><br></div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">// Quelque part dans mon code</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">DeclareProcedureNotification(\"Liste.MajDonnées\", () =&gt; {</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">    // Un autre super code</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">    Info(\"Liste clients actualisée\")</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">})</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\"><br></div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">// Pendant ce temps-là, dans la fenêtre Veracruz</div><div class=\"ql-code-block\" data-language=\"plain\">Notifie(\"MajDonnées\")</div></div><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">➡ Résultat :</span></p><p><br></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Toutes vos fenêtres ou Dashboards se mettent à jour automatiquement</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Avec un code concis et modulaire</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">✅</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Fun fact</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">: ce code est directement inspiré d’un</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">exemple fourni avec WinDev</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">. Comme quoi, fouiller dans les exemples WinDev réserve parfois de</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">très bonnes surprises</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">😉</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Pour les plus joueurs, on peut faire du</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">multi paramètre</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(parce que… pourquoi pas ?)</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p><br></p>","author":"Fabien","category":"Tuto","status":"published","images":[{"name":"image-1.png","mimeType":"image/png","data":""},{"name":"image-2.png","mimeType":"image/png","data":""}],"thumbnail":{"name":"1754033872488.png","mimeType":"image/png","data":""}}